{"skill":{"slug":"habit-tracker","displayName":"Habit Tracker"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769326386777,"changelog":"Initial release of habit-tracker.\n\n- Track daily and weekly habits with streak counts and progress visualization.\n- Log habit completions via conversation.\n- Set reminders for specific habits.\n- Flexible support for daily, weekly, or custom cadence habits.\n- Options to pause, archive, or review habit statistics.\n- All data stored locally for privacy.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1507,"sha256":"57692c155d1a17dac483d8d3542e32393911f0f0fd5d414ff64b6d5815d9d29b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1787,"sha256":"289ce4f9cd9cd8affe085fe91fcd07c4b8281851338a148217a768dd9ef7f695","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789017597433,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"8133d59b2733f633a8fe579737df148b734a459e259116ce36c61584caa90395","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/8133d59b2733f633a8fe579737df148b734a459e259116ce36c61584caa90395","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: habit-tracker\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains only metadata (`_meta.json`) and documentation (`SKILL.md`). The `SKILL.md` file describes a 'habit-tracker' skill, detailing its functionality and usage. There is no executable code provided in this bundle. The documentation is straightforward, lacks any prompt injection attempts against the AI agent, and does not suggest any malicious or suspicious activities like data exfiltration, remote execution, or persistence. The statement 'All data stored locally' further indicates a benign intent.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159907278},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":11,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789017597433},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a straightforward habit tracker with disclosed local habit data and reminder behavior, with only minor accidental-activation risk from broad trigger phrases.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local storage of habit history is proportionate to tracking streaks and progress, and the artifact discloses that habit data is stored locally.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact consists of a Markdown SKILL.md file with no executable scripts, dependencies, remote payload retrieval, or install-time commands.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger phrases are habit-related but fairly broad, so an agent should confirm before creating, logging, archiving, or reminding from ambiguous user wording.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill expects persistent local habit history and optional reminders, which are purpose-aligned and disclosed; no evidence of privilege escalation, system hooks, or hidden background services was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The described capabilities are limited to creating habits, logging completions, tracking streaks, showing progress, and optional reminders, all matching the stated habit-tracking purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that habit names, completion history, skips, and reminders may reveal personal routines. Use clear phrasing and confirm any state-changing action if the assistant appears to infer a habit entry from casual conversation.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad habit-related triggers could cause unintended activation, but they are aligned with the skill's purpose and do not show hidden or unrelated authority.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789017597433}}}}}